      "reason": "The allowed-imports whitelist (backtrader, math, collections, statistics) excludes `random`, so a stochastic exploration policy cannot be implemented; optimistic initialization is the standard randomness-free substitute that still guarantees every action is tried instead of the degenerate always-NOTHING policy."
    },
