    },
    {
      "topic": "stop-loss / take-profit mechanics",
      "choice": "On position entry the fill price is recorded; each subsequent bar the intrabar High/Low is compared to the 2%/4% stop/target levels, and self.close() is issued the first bar either level is touched, taking priority over the Q-learning action for that bar.",
      "reason": "Spec states flat percentage stop-loss/take-profit 'for all positions' but not the trigger granularity; checking High/Low (rather than only Close) is the more literal reading of a price 'reaching' a level intrabar."
    },
    {
