      "choice": "Action space is masked by position status: only NOTHING/BUY/SELL are legal while flat, only NOTHING/CLOSE while in a long or short position (which also enforces the canonical single-position-at-a-time default).",
      "reason": "This directly satisfies the stated 'avoid opening a new position if a position in the opposite direction is already open' rule and simultaneously implements the bench's no-pyramiding default, since the spec does not separately permit same-direction pyramiding."
    },
